            {
                "entry_id": "2904ef0a-d75a-3185-9993-bbdfd00943da",
                "word": "mechanicals",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b35b0d8b-b3f3-3e03-bd6b-3dfa8630201c",
                        "entry_id": "2904ef0a-d75a-3185-9993-bbdfd00943da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "mechanical fixtures and fittings."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "78515664-7248-47e0-90e5-99995b3153c5",
                                "sense_id": "b35b0d8b-b3f3-3e03-bd6b-3dfa8630201c",
                                "text": "The mechanicals — mirror cell, focuser, and so on — were much better than what Robert had made himself in the 60s, and the optics were, if not quite up to the best premium custom optics, probably better than Robert could have produced himself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fe7ec9c-491a-456f-a798-45d2c95cda46",
                                "sense_id": "b35b0d8b-b3f3-3e03-bd6b-3dfa8630201c",
                                "text": "You only want to make sure the mechanicals are all sound and you will do this though having a Home Inspection and the realtor can write a clause on the offer - that the Seller pay for the repairs of anything wrong or you can negotiate that on your offer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b77cbf82-8b3c-4f9d-a89c-61b097819aa4",
                                "sense_id": "b35b0d8b-b3f3-3e03-bd6b-3dfa8630201c",
                                "text": "Remodeling basements is all about problem-solving, because no other space has the same constraints on floor space, headroom, access, and mechanicals."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2042ebc-af06-4370-bfd5-1e7542b8c837",
                                "sense_id": "b35b0d8b-b3f3-3e03-bd6b-3dfa8630201c",
                                "text": "There was nothing the matter with the mechanicals of Dan's car even now, after a two hundred foot plunge into a canyon."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4064b3d-0506-3535-a1be-ef665f4a6d36",
                        "entry_id": "2904ef0a-d75a-3185-9993-bbdfd00943da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Royalties on the sale of recordings in the form of records, CDs, tapes, or similar objects."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cdb7497f-b90d-4c6f-a5a9-560a73b2defa",
                                "sense_id": "f4064b3d-0506-3535-a1be-ef665f4a6d36",
                                "text": "Music publishers make money by having their songs performed on records and then collecting the royalties, known as “mechanicals,” from record companies who release them, and “performance” royalties from the radio plays."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de4fff8b-8b12-4887-8369-68bcf880b3eb",
                                "sense_id": "f4064b3d-0506-3535-a1be-ef665f4a6d36",
                                "text": "Know that your publisher understands and loves them and that your publisher wants you to get a record deal so that they can start making money off you via the mechanicals."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4d8052b-99be-4e88-ad72-03119d4a101b",
                                "sense_id": "f4064b3d-0506-3535-a1be-ef665f4a6d36",
                                "text": "Composers and songwriters can earn royalties from many sources including record, CD, and tape sales (mechanicals), U.S. and foreign television, cable and radio performances, theater performances, downloads, streaming, and artist and record producer royalties, among others."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3530c870-1188-4d3a-877a-bc52a7db28d4",
                                "sense_id": "f4064b3d-0506-3535-a1be-ef665f4a6d36",
                                "text": "Through the thirties, there was just a trickle of income from record sales, or “mechanicals.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
